&lt;li&gt;Solid experience designing and developing &lt;strong&gt;REST APIs&lt;/strong&gt; and backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;object-oriented programming, design pattern&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
